envoy_toolshed_jq module root marker.

Lets callers that run their own jq (eg `jqcat`'s `JQ_MODULES_ROOT_MARKER`)
derive the on-disk directory containing this module's `*.jq` files for jq's
`-L` search path, via `$(dirname <path of //:modules_root.marker>)`. Prefer
`//:jq`, which needs no module root. Do not remove or rename while callers
use it.
